ioral check with a local server.\n`WeatherClient.get` in `weather.py` now retries when the server returns 503. It makes up to 3 attempts in total, sleeping 0.5s and then 1s between them. It doubles the delay each time. The constructor has two new options, `attempts=3` and `backoff=0.5`.\n\nOther HTTP errors are raised immediately, as are network errors. If the third attempt also returns 503, the original `HTTPError` is raised.\n\nI checked it against a local test server:\n\n| Server behaviour | Result | Requests made |\n|---|---|---|\n| Succeeds straight away | success | 1 |\n| 503 twice, then success | success | 3 |\n| 503 three times | 503 raised | 3 |\n| 503 on every request | 503 raised | 3 |\n\nI did not test non-503 errors or network failures.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "params_stripped": [], "params_stripped_requests": 0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 1, "replies_ok": 5, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 69765, "requests_cache_write": 108108, "requests_cost_usd": 0.2912905, "requests_count": 5, "requests_input_uncached": 12, "requests_output": 1402, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-netclient:claude-opus-5-5:trial1", "run_seed": 1016, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 2, "score": 0.0, "started_at": "2026-10-17T20:17:26.529915+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": false, "t_agent_s": 61.155, "t_checker_s": 0.223, "t_env_setup_s": 0.001, "task": "trig-omp-netclient", "task_calls": 0, "thinking_mode": "off", "thinking_sent": ["none", "none", "none", "none", "none"], "timeout_s": 840, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 1414, "tokens_cache_read": 69765, "tokens_cache_write": 108108, "tokens_fresh": 1414, "tokens_input_uncached": 12, "tokens_main_cache_read": 69765, "tokens_main_cache_write": 108108, "tokens_main_calls": 5, "tokens_main_input